OL,3,GNEWSAAgency says forest campsite could
OL,4,A'risk life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a campsite in a forest pose a
OL,7,F"risk to life" and could pollute
OL,8,Fwaterways, the Environment Agency (EA)
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FForestry England and Forest Holidays
OL,12,Fwant to build 70 cabins, a campsite,
OL,13,Fcafe, restaurant, shop and staff
OL,14,Faccommodation in Hamsterley Forest,
OL,15,FCounty Durham.
OL,17,FIn a letter of objection, the EA said
OL,18,Fthe campsite would be on a flood plain
OL,19,Fat the bottom of a valley meaning there
OL,20,Fwas a "danger" for campers.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
