OL,3,GNEWSAAgency says forest campsite could
OL,4,A'risk life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham County Council planning manager
OL,7,FStephen Reed, said he was unable to
OL,8,Fcomment on the EA's objection as it was
OL,9,Fa live application. Forest Holidays and
OL,10,FForestry England have been contacted
OL,11,Ffor comment.
